
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.034779466 0.013447626 -0.047413822) to (41.013221 40.613536 42.203414)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
